{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはりんごっ(o・・o)さゆりんごっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、楽しみにしていた\nさゆにゃんとひなちまがＷキャストで出演する\n學蘭歌劇『帝一の國』を観て来ました！！！\nさゆにゃんが美美子ちゃんとして\n出演する回を観たのですが\nほんまに面白くて、ほんまに可愛かった～(⑉꒦ິ^꒦ິ⑉)♡\n美美子ちゃん可愛いね(⑉꒦ິ^꒦ິ⑉)♡\nさゆにゃんほんまに良かったよ(⑉꒦ິ^꒦ິ⑉)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"學蘭歌劇『帝一の國』\n沢山笑えて、でも深く考えさせられる舞台でした！\nぜひ皆さんもPARCO劇場に\n足を運んでください！！\n松村も、次はひなちまが出てる回もみたい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対、原作も買おう♡♡\n絶対はまっちゃうわ～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「生のアイドルが好き」第１３回\n一周年６時間スペシャルでした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは愛乙女★DOLLさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2014/04/18/3301862/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Rayさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2014/04/18/3301862/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仮面女子さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2014/04/18/3301862/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Doll☆Elementsさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2014/04/18/3301862/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"paletさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2014/04/18/3301862/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村、変なポーズで\n木元さんとかなが近い、、、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2014/04/18/3301862/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"６時間の放送如何でしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントをくださったアイドルの皆さん\nそして乃木坂46のメンバーも\n有難うですヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しくて\n全然疲れたりせず\n最後まで笑いっ放しでした♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来場者は７万人を超え\n当初の目標の１０万を\n大きく上回った\n1５万３千ものコメントを頂きました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に有難うございます(>_<)♡\nかなと 絶対１０万いかへんよ～って\n言ってたので\n本当にびっくりしたし嬉しかったです♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもずっとずっと続けられるように\n頑張ります！！\n来月も、また観てな♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、なんと４月2６日の\nニコニコ超会議３に\n「生のアイドルが好き」が\n出張出演することになりましたヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ\nぜひ、遊びに来て下さいな♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2014/04/18/3301862/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへっ♡\n一周年やから苺タルト貰ったぜ♡♡\nめっちゃ嬉しい♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんこれからも\nよろしくお願いします♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、明日もお仕事がんばります♡\n皆も一日お疲れ様♡\n明日も、ふぁいと～\\( ˆoˆ )/"}],"source":"archive"}